{"variants":[{"paths":["\/documentation\/oudsfoundations\/swift\/dictionary\/subscript(orkey:)"],"traits":[{"interfaceLanguage":"swift"}]}],"identifier":{"interfaceLanguage":"swift","url":"doc:\/\/OUDSFoundations\/documentation\/OUDSFoundations\/Swift\/Dictionary\/subscript(orKey:)"},"metadata":{"title":"subscript(orKey:)","roleHeading":"Instance Subscript","conformance":{"availabilityPrefix":[{"text":"Available when","type":"text"}],"constraints":[{"code":"Key","type":"codeVoice"},{"text":" is ","type":"text"},{"code":"PostScriptFontNamesMapKey","type":"codeVoice"},{"text":" and ","type":"text"},{"code":"Value","type":"codeVoice"},{"text":" is ","type":"text"},{"code":"String","type":"codeVoice"},{"text":".","type":"text"}],"conformancePrefix":[{"text":"Conforms when","type":"text"}]},"fragments":[{"text":"subscript","kind":"keyword"},{"text":"(","kind":"text"},{"text":"orKey","kind":"externalParam"},{"text":" _: ","kind":"text"},{"text":"Key","kind":"typeIdentifier"},{"text":") -> ","kind":"text"},{"preciseIdentifier":"s:SS","text":"String","kind":"typeIdentifier"}],"extendedModule":"Swift","symbolKind":"subscript","externalID":"s:SD15OUDSFoundationsAA25PostScriptFontNamesMapKeyVRszSSRs_rlE02orG0SSAC_tcip","role":"symbol","modules":[{"relatedModules":["Swift"],"name":"Foundations"}]},"primaryContentSections":[{"declarations":[{"tokens":[{"text":"subscript","kind":"keyword"},{"text":"(","kind":"text"},{"text":"orKey","kind":"externalParam"},{"text":" ","kind":"text"},{"text":"key","kind":"internalParam"},{"text":": ","kind":"text"},{"text":"Key","kind":"typeIdentifier"},{"text":") -> ","kind":"text"},{"preciseIdentifier":"s:SS","text":"String","kind":"typeIdentifier"},{"text":" { ","kind":"text"},{"text":"get","kind":"keyword"},{"text":" }","kind":"text"}],"platforms":["macOS"],"languages":["swift"]}],"kind":"declarations"},{"kind":"parameters","parameters":[{"content":[{"inlineContent":[{"type":"text","text":"The key to use to get a value"}],"type":"paragraph"}],"name":"key"}]},{"content":[{"anchor":"overview","level":2,"type":"heading","text":"Overview"},{"inlineContent":[{"text":"In fact if it seems some rules are missing, or weight are not managed, if the font family only is returned","type":"text"},{"text":" ","type":"text"},{"text":"the user has an higher probability to use the expected font. Because if a mashup of family name and weight is returned","type":"text"},{"text":" ","type":"text"},{"text":"it can produce a PostScript identifier not available, so not usable, so implying a fallback to default system font like ","type":"text"},{"inlineContent":[{"type":"text","text":"San Francisco"}],"type":"emphasis"},{"text":".","type":"text"},{"text":" ","type":"text"},{"text":"Because PostScript identifiers in most of cases do not have whitespaces, remove them.","type":"text"}],"type":"paragraph"},{"code":["    \/\/ Given a dictionary with one value","    let myDict: PostScriptFontNamesMap = [PSFNMK(\"Arial\", Font.Weight.bold): \"Aria-BoldMT\"]","","    \/\/ The given value is returned if the key exists","    let keyExists = myDict[PSFNMK(\"Arial\", Font.Weight.bold)] \/\/ Arial-BoldMT","","    \/\/ But if the key does not exist, the only the key is returned","    let keyDoesNotExist = myDict[PSFNMK(\"Luciole\", Font.Weight.bold)] \/\/ Luciole"],"type":"codeListing","syntax":"swift"}],"kind":"content"}],"schemaVersion":{"major":0,"minor":3,"patch":0},"sections":[],"hierarchy":{"paths":[["doc:\/\/OUDSFoundations\/documentation\/OUDSFoundations","doc:\/\/OUDSFoundations\/documentation\/OUDSFoundations\/Swift","doc:\/\/OUDSFoundations\/documentation\/OUDSFoundations\/Swift\/Dictionary"]]},"abstract":[{"type":"text","text":"If there is no value for the given "},{"code":"key","type":"codeVoice"},{"type":"text","text":", returns the description of this key,"},{"type":"text","text":" "},{"type":"text","text":"i.e.font family name without the font weight in the end and without whitespaces."}],"kind":"symbol","references":{"doc://OU